<title>FRANCE: SOCCER-PARIS ST GERMAIN 2 LIVERPOOL 0 - LATEST.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-PARIS ST GERMAIN 2 LIVERPOOL 0 - LATEST.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Paris St Germanin led Liverpool 2-0 in the first leg of their European Cup Winners' Cup semifinal on Thursday.</p>
<p>Scorer: Leonardo 10, Cauet 42</p>
